WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.413 --> 00:00:01.775
- [James] I think people have taken to Eli

00:00:01.775 --> 00:00:03.728
'cause people in this community

00:00:03.728 --> 00:00:07.416
were always looking for
something to be passionate about.

00:00:07.416 --> 00:00:08.728
Before Eli came,

00:00:08.728 --> 00:00:10.912
we had people that said
it couldn't be done.

00:00:10.912 --> 00:00:12.505
But through perseverance,

00:00:12.505 --> 00:00:14.537
we won a county
championship in basketball.

00:00:14.537 --> 00:00:15.872
- [Eli] I'm Eli Brooks.

00:00:15.872 --> 00:00:19.455
My dad has been my
coach for my whole life.

00:00:23.569 --> 00:00:25.057
- I'm James Brooks.

00:00:25.057 --> 00:00:27.107
I'm the Spring Grove
boys' basketball coach.

00:00:27.107 --> 00:00:28.576
- [Eli] My dad started coaching me

00:00:28.576 --> 00:00:29.569
when I was in first grade,

00:00:29.569 --> 00:00:31.705
when I wasn't even allowed
to play on the Y team.

00:00:31.705 --> 00:00:34.073
- [James] Spring Grove is
built around the paper mill.

00:00:34.073 --> 00:00:36.528
The community is really close-knit,

00:00:36.528 --> 00:00:38.753
passionate about their sports,

00:00:38.753 --> 00:00:41.426
but last time we won a
championship was 1971.

00:00:41.426 --> 00:00:43.336
(cheering)

00:00:43.336 --> 00:00:47.475
They were looking for
something to cheer for.

00:00:47.475 --> 00:00:50.013
- [Eli] What I love about
basketball is the teamwork

00:00:50.013 --> 00:00:52.499
and the friendships that I made.

00:00:52.499 --> 00:00:54.323
Basketball teaches a lot of things.

00:00:54.323 --> 00:00:55.874
Treating people the right way,

00:00:55.874 --> 00:00:58.563
taking care of the younger
kids that are looking up to me,

00:00:58.563 --> 00:00:59.962
making sure my actions are in line

00:00:59.962 --> 00:01:02.291
with what my parents have taught me.

00:01:02.291 --> 00:01:04.187
Saying goodbye to Spring Grove,

00:01:04.187 --> 00:01:05.290
is gonna be hard.

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:08.913
My dad has been my basketball
coach for 10 years now.

00:01:08.913 --> 00:01:10.346
I learned so much from him

00:01:10.346 --> 00:01:13.611
throughout basketball and
just life experiences.

00:01:13.611 --> 00:01:17.067
- [James] It'll be exciting to
see Eli in his cap and gown.

00:01:17.067 --> 00:01:18.565
- [Eli] Getting dressed up puts you

00:01:18.565 --> 00:01:20.859
in a frame of mind of maturity.

00:01:20.859 --> 00:01:23.176
I just want to see the
excitement on my parents' faces

00:01:23.176 --> 00:01:24.931
when I walk across the stage.

00:01:24.931 --> 00:01:27.140
I'm my dad's child, pretty much,

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:29.587
so that's gonna be tough for him.

00:01:29.587 --> 00:01:30.773
We did a lot of things together

00:01:30.773 --> 00:01:32.411
that are just, like, everyday things,

00:01:32.411 --> 00:01:34.166
but I think he'll miss 'em.

00:01:34.166 --> 00:01:35.219
- I think it's important that he goes out

00:01:35.219 --> 00:01:37.491
and ventures and shows everybody else

00:01:37.491 --> 00:01:40.492
that he is that special kid.

00:01:40.492 --> 00:01:43.561
I'm sure me and his mom will cry.

00:01:43.561 --> 00:01:46.144
I'm proud to be your dad, um...

00:01:50.204 --> 00:01:54.371
You've taken our community
to a place it has never seen.

00:01:55.926 --> 00:01:58.791
Why am I getting choked up for the camera?

00:01:58.791 --> 00:02:01.765
Share the ball, make good
plays, knock shots out.

00:02:01.765 --> 00:02:04.348
(upbeat music)

00:02:05.744 --> 00:02:07.926
I'm gonna continue on and coach next year.

00:02:07.926 --> 00:02:10.279
Everybody's encouraged on someone local

00:02:10.279 --> 00:02:12.878
making it to a big university.

00:02:12.878 --> 00:02:15.045
(clapping)

00:02:15.045 --> 00:02:16.985
- [Eli] I think that my dad's
coming back for another season

00:02:16.985 --> 00:02:19.299
just shows his commitment
to the community.

00:02:19.299 --> 00:02:21.321
The ball stops bouncing at some point.

00:02:21.321 --> 00:02:23.513
Probably the biggest thing
that you can get out of a sport

00:02:23.513 --> 00:02:25.400
is just interactions with other people.

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:27.537
You really have to give
back to your community

00:02:27.537 --> 00:02:29.370
what they gave to you.

00:02:31.224 --> 00:02:33.391
(beeping)

